{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひ・と・め・ぼ・れ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ということで！105回目のファンの方が\n考えてくださった今日の冒頭あいさつは\nみすたーこんさんからいただきました！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お米だいすき"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"白米だいすき"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この、ツアー中\n毎日きちんとご飯食べてる"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だってさ、各地の美味しい食べ物を食べてると白米が欲しくなるんだもん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あゝ、食べ物って素敵"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/04/20/6382700/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダーライブ全国ツアー 東北シリーズ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2日目  in宮城"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おわりましたー！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"つくづく思うのです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アドレナリンってやっべっぞっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"エネルギーチャージのために\n食べ物や飲み物を普段と変えるのも大事ですが、アドレナリンってすごい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アドレナリンであってるのかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"宮城のライブに来てくださった方、\nありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とても楽しかったです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ！そう！あのね！\n今日、カフェラテかカフェモカか\nどっちにしようか考えてた時に\n花奈さんがいたから\n花奈さんに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「カフェモカとカフェラテってどっちが甘いですかー？」\nって聞いたら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「カフェモカかな？いや、でもミルクで割ってる方が甘いかもしれない！でも、私はカフェモカを飲むかな！」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"正確にではないですが、\nこんなようなことを言われたので\n花奈さんを信じて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カフェモカを飲んだら苦くて！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「花奈さんに苦いじゃないですか！！！」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って言ったら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「ミルクでわってる方が甘いかもしれないっていったじゃん！！！」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って言われて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「花奈さんカフェモカ飲むって言ったじゃないですか！！！」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って言ったら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「そもそもカフェラテでも、カフェモカでもなくエスプレッソの方が飲む！」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って言わました！！！！(╥ω╥`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まったく！！！٩(๑`^´๑)۶\n花奈さん٩(๑`^´๑)۶！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"苦かったカフェモカは、純奈ちゃんにあげました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は、まだ\nミルクコーヒーと牛乳を割った"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ミミとコーヒー(小さい頃からそう呼んでる)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"が、いいかな♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"能條さんが、\n苦手なブラックコーヒーを\n苦しそうに飲み干すところを時々見かけるんですが、能條さんが苦手なブラックコーヒーを飲む理由もちゃんとあることを知りました！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんとなく言わないけどね～♪笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから！私も\nブラックコーヒー飲み干したい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そいえば、この間まで\nひめちゃんコーヒーにはまってたな～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"20歳になる前にコーヒーを飲めるようになりたい！なんとなく！かっこいい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/04/20/6382700/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/04/20/6382700/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆうりさんとある曲で\n向き合うんですが\nあの瞬間はドキドキします！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/04/20/6382700/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヒナコセレクト(仮)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/04/20/6382700/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■(1)  たいそんさん■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬅︎きいちゃん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"➡︎なにちゃん！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■(175)  ゴールポスト直撃さん■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬅︎これからの乃木坂ライフは北野日奈子推しでいきます。\nライブ終了後にタオルマフラーもゲット！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"➡︎やったあー！嬉しいです！"},{"type":"break